HMAX=5
HMIN=1.0
NWAV=-200
DHDX=0.3
H0=50
HB=0.02
HFUN_HMAX=50
HFUN_HMIN=0.1
REGION=ARC
PS=1

## notes
## NWAV<0 turns off SWE spacing
## H0<0 turns off tanh depth spacing
## HMAX is maximum cell spacing in km
## HMIN is minimum cell spacing in km
## NWAV is M2 wavelengths per cell spacing using SWE. <0 turns off
## DHDX is maximum gradient for cells
## H0 centre depth in m for tanh depth scaling. <0 turns off
## HB width parameter for tanh depth scaling
## ARCTIC_HMAX_LAT latitude where I introduce a uniform hmax. set to 90 to turn off
## ARCTIC_HMAX_VAL uniform cell spacing above hmax_lat in km
## HFUN_HMAX maximum allowable in optimizing routine (not sure if necessary) in km
## HFUN_HMIN minimum allowable optimizing routine cell in km
## PS=1 for polar stereographic, 0 for local stereographic projection
